-- COCOON (compact GUI + giver/trader functions, with avatar icon)
-- Eggs = TRADE / Pets = GIVE / Gifts = GIVE / Trade Req = SEND ONLY
-- + Potion Releaser (ages target pets to age 6 with pet_age_potion)
-- + Pet Recycler (travels to Nursery, recycles pets, collects tickets)
-- + Crystal (when 18+ recycle pets: Nursery -> recycle -> tickets ->
--   buy pet_recycler_2025_crystal_egg. Crystal eggs NEVER go to the pen.
