--   (ant/mouse fallback, swapped out once a cracked egg is affordable).
--   CRYSTAL also ages 4 ants / 4 mice with age potions and fuses to neon;
--   neon ant / neon mouse are recycled)
-- + Pet Pen (PetFarm-style logic: commit progression, purge trash,
--   neon fusion, remove age-6 pets, refill priority:
--   inventory recycler eggs FIRST, then tickets -> recycler egg,
--   else Bucks -> cracked egg. Empty slots are ALWAYS filled.)
-- + Neon Fuser (4x full-grown same-species pets -> neon)
-- + Mega Fuser (4x age-6 same-species neons -> mega)
-- + Money & Ticket Display
-- + Trade License check at load: no license -> takes the test (from cocoon2.txt)
-- + FARM button (AR11): the AdoptMe Farm from cocoon.txt, embedded below,
--   Potion Farm preset + baby needs by default. No window of its own:
--   FARM / BABY NEEDS buttons and the Farm status line live in this GUI.
--   pet_recycler_2025_crystal_egg is NEVER equipped / hatched by the farm.
